WEBVTT

00:03.900 --> 00:05.460
<i><i>Personally...</i></i>

00:08.330 --> 00:12.180
<i><i>I liked Miyamura-kun's hair long.</i></i>

00:12.660 --> 00:14.560
Miyamura!

00:14.560 --> 00:17.430
They're making a sequel to 
that horror movie you liked.

00:17.430 --> 00:19.290
R-Really...?

00:21.020 --> 00:25.760
<i><i>He was one of the few kids in class 
who wore glasses like me,</i></i>

00:25.760 --> 00:28.250
<i><i>and his long hair gave him 
an air of mystery.</i></i>

00:29.530 --> 00:31.160
<i><i>It was great.</i></i>

00:31.550 --> 00:32.510
Watabe!

00:32.950 --> 00:35.510
About that reference book I asked about...

00:35.510 --> 00:37.920
Let's go see it when it hits the theater.

00:37.920 --> 00:41.520
What? Oh, um... sure.

00:41.520 --> 00:47.430
<i><i>But this fun-loving
Miyamura-kun is nice, too.</i></i>

00:42.370 --> 00:43.520
Watabe?

00:47.770 --> 00:50.840
Hey, Watabe, why'd you just take a picture?

00:50.840 --> 00:52.750
To memorialize Miyamura-kun.

00:52.750 --> 00:54.430
Memorialize him?

02:29.810 --> 02:32.000
Watabe-kun, what're you reading?

02:32.310 --> 02:33.440
Oh, Miyamura-kun!

02:33.440 --> 02:35.550
Is it a mystery novel?

02:35.550 --> 02:37.650
Yeah, it's really good.

02:37.650 --> 02:41.510
It's got some horror elements, 
but if you can get past those...

02:42.080 --> 02:43.400
Cool.

02:43.980 --> 02:47.540
You guys talk about horror 
stuff sometimes, right?

02:47.540 --> 02:51.210
I kind of like it, too. 
Especially Japanese horror movies.

02:51.210 --> 02:54.270
Oh, it's Hori-san who likes it.

02:54.840 --> 02:57.150
You two would probably get along great.

02:58.340 --> 03:01.660
Ah, I s-see...

03:02.790 --> 03:06.290
Oh, b-but I also like it, of course!

03:06.290 --> 03:09.910
Really? So you're into it, too, huh?

03:10.260 --> 03:11.220
Yeah...

03:12.670 --> 03:17.420
<i><i>What is this? Why is Watabe 
wearing his heart on his sleeve like this?</i></i>

03:17.420 --> 03:19.670
I can't believe we like the same stuff!

03:19.670 --> 03:22.210
I can recommend a few more books!

03:22.210 --> 03:23.520
Great...

03:25.240 --> 03:26.930
Hello, everyone!

03:26.930 --> 03:29.160
Miyamura-kun, listen to this!

03:29.160 --> 03:34.870
I made chawanmushi today! 
Let's all have some together!

03:34.870 --> 03:36.690
Chawanmushi, huh?

03:36.690 --> 03:38.720
Miyamura, listen to this!

03:38.720 --> 03:41.490
It has ginko nuts in it! I put them in!

03:41.490 --> 03:43.830
Hey, nice job!

03:43.830 --> 03:45.450
<i><i>Like father, like son.</i></i>

03:48.950 --> 03:49.830
Oh, Hori-s—

03:49.830 --> 03:50.870
Stop!

03:54.570 --> 03:56.510
Huh? Um...

03:57.470 --> 03:58.840
What is this?

03:59.410 --> 04:00.840
You stink of Watabe.

04:01.970 --> 04:04.770
It's normally Toru or Shindo-kun...

04:04.770 --> 04:07.220
H-H-Hold it! You're choking me!
I can't breathe!

04:07.220 --> 04:08.850
I usually smell one of them on you.

04:09.310 --> 04:12.290
How do you even know
what Watabe-kun smells like?

04:12.290 --> 04:15.100
I took samples in case 
something like this happened.

04:15.500 --> 04:17.160
<i><i>Something like what?</i></i>

04:17.160 --> 04:20.230
Can you really smell someone
after I just talk to them?

04:20.230 --> 04:23.840
Girls not register. Only guys register.

04:23.840 --> 04:25.680
Why are you talking like a robot?

04:26.390 --> 04:28.050
I don't smell anything.

04:28.050 --> 04:30.490
You don't need to be able to.

04:30.490 --> 04:32.170
I can, and that's what counts.

04:30.490 --> 04:32.500
<b>Great dog</b>

04:32.500 --> 04:34.220
No, I mean...

04:34.220 --> 04:38.670
I don't think I'd know if you'd
been with someone else.

04:39.750 --> 04:46.260
You mean if I hung out with a series 
of guys every day like you do?

04:46.260 --> 04:50.510
I don't like the way you phrased that,
but basically, yes.

04:51.470 --> 04:52.770
I'd never do that.

04:52.770 --> 04:54.980
No, it's not about that.

04:54.980 --> 04:59.060
If you hung out with Ishikawa-kun
or the student council president,

04:59.060 --> 05:02.030
I wouldn't be able to tell like you can.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.250
Okay, then I'll tell you.

05:04.580 --> 05:06.660
If I cheat on you, I'll come out and say it.

05:08.290 --> 05:09.660
Thanks, that's a big help.

05:09.660 --> 05:10.780
Right?

05:09.660 --> 05:12.910
<b>Weird</b>

05:10.410 --> 05:12.910
<b>Kinda weird</b>

05:10.780 --> 05:12.600
Dinner's ready!

05:15.250 --> 05:18.170
And then she gets all angry...

05:18.170 --> 05:22.300
It's not like I was any good 
at studying before.

05:22.300 --> 05:25.810
Of course, that means I need 
to buckle down even harder.

05:25.810 --> 05:27.430
Seems that way.

05:27.430 --> 05:30.110
You've got it pretty good, Ishikawa.

05:30.110 --> 05:33.680
If I so much as put some music on, 
the cord gets pulled out.

05:33.680 --> 05:36.460
Seriously? That's crazy.

05:36.460 --> 05:38.610
I wish they wouldn't expect so much from us.

05:38.610 --> 05:40.980
We're doing the best we can.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.310
<i><i>What was that about?!</i></i>

05:45.310 --> 05:47.450
<i><i>I can't tell...</i></i>

05:47.450 --> 05:49.950
Probably some Hori thing or something.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.700
Yeah, that checks out.

05:52.060 --> 05:54.580
They're both kinda weird.

05:54.580 --> 05:56.460
<b>Through
and
through</b>

05:56.890 --> 06:00.580
You so rarely invite me over. What's up?

06:00.580 --> 06:02.840
Not that I don't love coming.

06:02.840 --> 06:05.600
Oh, you don't need to return that controller.

06:05.600 --> 06:06.830
I have more at home.

06:06.830 --> 06:10.720
That's not why I called you here. 
And I'm not giving back the controller.

06:10.720 --> 06:13.170
What's up, then?

06:16.930 --> 06:18.180
Close...

06:18.180 --> 06:19.730
Close your eyes.

06:21.580 --> 06:22.700
Wait, what?

06:22.700 --> 06:24.420
Are you gonna do something to me?

06:24.420 --> 06:26.440
Yeah— Not really.

06:27.090 --> 06:28.450
It'll only take a moment.

06:28.450 --> 06:29.720
Wh-What will?

06:29.720 --> 06:31.830
What are you gonna do in that moment?

06:31.830 --> 06:33.200
Take my life?

06:33.580 --> 06:36.030
You wouldn't understand, so I'm not saying.

06:36.030 --> 06:37.580
Just hurry up and close your eyes.

06:37.580 --> 06:41.500
What?! What are you gonna 
do once I'm not looking?!

06:41.500 --> 06:44.590
Would you keep it quiet? Just calm down!

06:50.280 --> 06:53.570
There. Now I know what you smell like.

06:53.570 --> 06:55.970
You're the one most likely to make a move.

06:55.970 --> 06:57.020
On who?

06:57.020 --> 06:59.220
H-Huh? What's this about?

06:59.220 --> 07:00.190
Shut up.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.100
<b>Miyamura in Hori mode</b>

07:20.460 --> 07:23.500
Watabe, I honestly don't want to...

07:24.220 --> 07:27.130
But can I ask you something
that no one else will?

07:29.100 --> 07:29.880
Watabe.

07:29.880 --> 07:31.670
Oh, sorry.

07:32.000 --> 07:35.260
Hang on. I just gotta move these 
to my Miyamura-kun folder.

07:35.870 --> 07:38.390
I saw you take that picture 
of Miyamura before...

07:38.920 --> 07:40.850
Wait, your Miyamura folder?!

07:40.850 --> 07:42.060
That's creepy.

07:42.060 --> 07:46.220
Watabe, do you... y'know...

07:46.860 --> 07:48.510
like Miyamura?

07:48.930 --> 07:51.400
It goes far beyond liking him.

07:52.340 --> 07:54.280
I can't explain it.

07:54.280 --> 07:55.650
It's a great fascination.

07:55.650 --> 07:57.650
Wh-What?

07:57.870 --> 08:00.340
But Miyamura has a girlfriend.

08:00.340 --> 08:03.610
Sorry, Ishikawa-kun. 
I don't know what you're getting at.

08:03.610 --> 08:06.540
Miyamura-kun dating the
opposite sex is just adorable.

08:06.830 --> 08:10.520
He has guy friends at other schools, too.

08:10.520 --> 08:11.910
Like Shindo.

08:12.380 --> 08:15.770
So Miyamura-kun has guy friends 
at other schools, eh?

08:17.870 --> 08:18.840
<i><i>So creepy!</i></i>

08:18.840 --> 08:22.060
<i><i>No! I shouldn't think that about my friends!</i></i>

08:22.060 --> 08:23.440
<b>Conflicted</b>

08:24.050 --> 08:27.520
So, Watabe, you're satisfied 
just watching Miyamura?

08:27.850 --> 08:29.750
I'd love to touch him if I could!

08:29.750 --> 08:32.150
Sorry, that isn't what I meant.

08:32.530 --> 08:34.860
Do you think you want to talk to him?

08:34.860 --> 08:37.370
Don't worry about that! I recorded him!

08:37.370 --> 08:39.430
<i><i>Hey, Watabe-kun!</i></i>

08:39.430 --> 08:41.930
<i><i>I'm getting more worried...</i></i>

08:42.320 --> 08:43.410
Hey!

08:43.860 --> 08:45.210
Come play with us!

08:45.210 --> 08:48.420
<b>Watabe vision</b>

08:48.420 --> 08:56.120
Ishikawa-kun, even if a two-kilometer asteroid
fell on me right now, I would die happy.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.320
He's shining so brightly.

08:57.320 --> 09:00.810
Are you sure? An asteroid that 
size would kill Miyamura, too.

09:02.250 --> 09:04.570
You stink!

09:04.570 --> 09:05.860
I can smell him!

09:05.860 --> 09:07.810
It's Watabe again!

09:08.560 --> 09:11.140
His scent is even stronger today!

09:11.140 --> 09:12.960
He's marking you!

09:12.960 --> 09:14.100
You're ripping it!

09:16.130 --> 09:19.140
I don't really understand...

09:19.140 --> 09:21.570
but you're saying 
Watabe-kun got close to me?

09:21.570 --> 09:26.580
You smell of Shindo-kun and Tanihara too,
 but Watabe's scent is the strongest.

09:27.260 --> 09:34.400
After all, Watabe has a stronger interest 
in you than any of the other guys.

09:34.400 --> 09:37.090
How does his scent tell you that much?

09:37.790 --> 09:41.990
I didn't even touch him.

09:41.990 --> 09:44.830
It doesn't matter if you touched him or not.

09:59.300 --> 10:02.350
I know what <i>you</i> smell like, at least.

10:02.350 --> 10:06.140
I can't really tell with 
Yoshikawa-san or Ayasaki-san.

10:09.670 --> 10:11.930
I thought you'd finally do it.

10:11.930 --> 10:12.840
Huh?

10:12.840 --> 10:14.500
You turned around so suddenly...

10:14.880 --> 10:17.760
I thought you were finally going
 to be rough with me!

10:17.760 --> 10:19.940
Stop getting my hopes up!

10:19.940 --> 10:23.170
W-Was what I did so bad 
that it made you cry?!

10:23.170 --> 10:23.800
I'm sorry!

10:23.800 --> 10:24.890
Don't touch me!

10:24.890 --> 10:26.860
Miyamura, you dummy!

10:25.180 --> 10:31.020
<b>Jealousy</b>

10:27.310 --> 10:31.020
No more deodorizer, please!

10:38.060 --> 10:39.480
Were you in an accident?

10:39.480 --> 10:41.580
Nope, a man-made disaster.

10:41.580 --> 10:42.530
Hori, huh?

10:42.900 --> 10:45.100
Why? Did you have another fight?

10:45.100 --> 10:45.870
Yeah.

10:45.870 --> 10:48.410
She really got you good.

10:48.780 --> 10:52.420
I'm not apologizing this time, 
no matter what.

10:54.090 --> 10:55.420
Good morning.

10:55.420 --> 10:57.620
Hori-san, what happened to your face?

10:57.620 --> 10:59.180
That must hurt!

10:59.180 --> 11:01.170
Dude, did you hit her back?

11:01.170 --> 11:02.430
No way!

11:05.740 --> 11:07.310
Miyamura, you dummy!

11:08.100 --> 11:11.060
What is it? If you wanna 
say something, out with it!

11:11.520 --> 11:13.230
No, I don't.

11:13.230 --> 11:16.670
You're talking dumb stuff, 
so I'm going home, dummy.

11:16.670 --> 11:18.820
Hey, who are you calling a dummy?!

11:18.820 --> 11:21.080
You really piss me off!

11:23.830 --> 11:27.930
She got so worked up she 
smacked right into the wall.

11:29.200 --> 11:31.850
So, what were you fighting about?

11:32.200 --> 11:34.330
I forgot, just like always.

11:35.250 --> 11:38.960
This time, I won't budge 
until Hori-san apologizes!

11:39.350 --> 11:40.910
How manly.

11:40.910 --> 11:42.400
Yeah, good luck with that.

11:42.720 --> 11:45.720
<b>Student Council</b>

11:43.570 --> 11:45.720
I can't believe him!

11:46.130 --> 11:48.720
He wasn't even the least bit bothered!

11:49.120 --> 11:51.580
Stupid Miyamura!

11:52.060 --> 11:53.850
Th-There, there...

11:53.850 --> 11:58.860
Still, it's not about another girl. 
Maybe it's not that big a deal?

11:59.870 --> 12:01.810
Guys are just as dangerous.

12:01.810 --> 12:03.310
You okay, Kyon-Kyon?

12:03.310 --> 12:04.740
Did you hit your head?

12:04.740 --> 12:06.780
Are you listening, Sengoku?!

12:09.330 --> 12:11.070
Why not just apologize to him?

12:11.070 --> 12:12.370
Why should I?!

12:12.370 --> 12:15.120
Why should you?

12:15.120 --> 12:18.130
What will you do if Miyamura-kun...

12:18.130 --> 12:22.060
stops caring about you, Kyo-chan?

12:23.630 --> 12:28.680
This could mean losing someone
who's always been there for you.

12:28.680 --> 12:31.340
<i><i>When Sengoku says it, it pisses me off,</i></i>

12:31.340 --> 12:33.890
<i><i>but when Kono-san says it, 
it brings me to my senses.</i></i>

12:34.460 --> 12:36.510
I... I guess you're right.

12:36.510 --> 12:37.650
Hey.

12:37.650 --> 12:41.030
But I'm still angry.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.750
<i>This is gonna take a while...</i>

12:44.540 --> 12:47.410
Each group has to submit their feedback.

12:47.410 --> 12:49.580
<b>Ignooore</b>

12:49.900 --> 12:52.590
I'm gonna put this together. 
That okay with you?

12:52.590 --> 12:53.750
Sure.

12:55.040 --> 12:58.790
<b>RUMBLE</b>

12:55.990 --> 12:58.410
Who cares if you answered at the same time?!

12:59.610 --> 13:03.330
Damn, you guys are tiring <i>me</i> out.

13:03.330 --> 13:05.320
Sorry to involve you.

13:05.630 --> 13:08.020
Honestly, I'm tired, too.

13:08.020 --> 13:11.630
Why am I so angry again?

13:11.630 --> 13:15.440
Come on. At least remember 
the reason you were fighting.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.900
You guys need to make up quick.

13:17.900 --> 13:19.850
I want to.

13:20.970 --> 13:22.360
Hey, a message.

13:22.360 --> 13:24.070
Hori-san

13:22.360 --> 13:24.070
My period's late
Dummy

13:27.190 --> 13:28.590
Ready to die?

13:30.080 --> 13:31.450
Hori-san

13:30.080 --> 13:31.450
Just kidding, dummy

13:34.070 --> 13:35.510
Yoshikawa, I need some tissues.

13:35.510 --> 13:38.080
Ew, Toru, you smell like apples.

13:40.250 --> 13:42.900
<i><i>What am I doing?</i></i>

13:43.970 --> 13:47.280
<i><i>How stupid can I be?
I just need to say I'm sorry.</i></i>

13:47.670 --> 13:49.370
<i><i>This is my fault.</i></i>

13:53.570 --> 13:55.630
Miyamura, c'mere.

13:55.630 --> 13:56.890
Have you seen Hori?

13:58.820 --> 14:01.250
She wasn't in class.

14:02.170 --> 14:04.040
And she wasn't in the clinic.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.760
Or the changing room. I'm worried.

14:06.760 --> 14:09.060
The changing room? Did you go in there?

14:09.060 --> 14:11.100
Well, that aside...

14:11.100 --> 14:12.490
Did you go in?

14:12.490 --> 14:16.770
She left her bag behind, 
and it's cold outside.

14:16.770 --> 14:18.000
Yeah.

14:18.520 --> 14:20.500
Huh? Outside?

14:32.860 --> 14:34.310
<i><i>There she is.</i></i>

14:36.580 --> 14:37.680
What?

14:42.520 --> 14:43.750
Nothing.

14:46.010 --> 14:49.650
You don't care about me anymore, right?

14:49.650 --> 14:50.730
Huh?

14:51.070 --> 14:53.910
You might not be with me someday, right?

14:53.910 --> 14:55.210
Uh...

14:56.080 --> 14:58.540
You hate me, don't you?

14:59.180 --> 15:00.460
Why would I?

15:01.790 --> 15:04.430
B-Because I...

15:06.780 --> 15:09.120
What? Are you crying?

15:09.590 --> 15:12.980
Come on. There's nothing to cry about it.

15:12.980 --> 15:19.190
But... But... I always...

15:19.190 --> 15:23.880
get angry and treat you unfairly...

15:24.470 --> 15:25.860
<i><i>So she realizes it.</i></i>

15:26.360 --> 15:29.270
Let me see your face, Hori-san.

15:31.360 --> 15:32.460
There!

15:33.820 --> 15:34.820
Hey...

15:35.370 --> 15:38.400
Wow, Hori-san's in tears.

15:39.830 --> 15:42.570
I guess even monsters can cry.

15:42.570 --> 15:45.720
Your nose and ears are red and everything.

15:46.490 --> 15:49.630
She's crying, crying, crying up a river.

15:50.250 --> 15:52.230
How embarrassing!

15:53.570 --> 15:55.390
Shut up!

15:55.390 --> 15:58.520
H-How can you be so nice?!

15:58.520 --> 16:02.630
You make me worry what would 
happen if you started hating me!

16:03.620 --> 16:07.270
Wh-What? That's what you were worried about?

16:07.680 --> 16:13.280
Hori-san, you always call me a dummy, 
but you're just as much of a fool.

16:13.280 --> 16:17.780
I know that! You really are a dummy!

16:17.780 --> 16:19.790
Oh, so you knew.

16:20.340 --> 16:26.790
Also, I like you a lot more
than you seem to realize.

16:27.720 --> 16:29.960
It'd be really hard to hate you.

16:30.800 --> 16:33.690
You always say stuff like that, dummy!

16:33.690 --> 16:35.290
Dummymura!

16:35.290 --> 16:37.550
It's true, though.

16:38.580 --> 16:41.870
Okay then, I'm sorry I like you.

16:45.270 --> 16:49.690
Damn, I apologized even though
 it wasn't my fault.

16:49.690 --> 16:53.700
That's right! You didn't do anything wrong!

16:53.700 --> 16:56.170
It's always my fault!

16:56.170 --> 16:57.240
Got it?

16:57.240 --> 16:58.560
Yeah.

16:58.930 --> 17:01.320
I dunno what they're talking about,

17:01.320 --> 17:04.780
but Hori kicked Miyamura
in the gut, didn't she?

17:04.780 --> 17:05.860
Yeah.

17:06.520 --> 17:08.310
<i>Scary.</i>

17:10.310 --> 17:11.710
Good morning.

17:11.710 --> 17:14.630
Hey! Morning, Miya...mura...

17:17.660 --> 17:19.350
<i><i>A hoodie?!</i></i>

17:19.700 --> 17:21.200
What's up with that, Miyamura?

17:21.200 --> 17:23.770
It doesn't really suit you.

17:23.770 --> 17:25.590
That looks like a nice, warm hoodie.

17:25.350 --> 17:28.980
<b>Honest friends</b>

17:25.590 --> 17:27.080
It doesn't really suit you, though.

17:27.080 --> 17:28.550
Thanks for that.

17:28.980 --> 17:30.720
I've never seen you in one.

17:31.370 --> 17:34.930
Erm, all my clothes are in the wash.

17:34.930 --> 17:35.740
I see.

17:36.650 --> 17:38.870
It's nice to change things up a bit.

17:39.730 --> 17:40.430
M...

17:40.870 --> 17:42.510
Maybe you're right.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.220
Yep.

17:43.660 --> 17:44.950
Morning!

17:44.950 --> 17:46.870
Hey, someone let me borrow 
their modern Japanese book!

17:47.240 --> 17:49.960
Whoa, what's this, Miyamura? 
We're both wearing hoodies!

17:49.960 --> 17:51.630
Are you copying my style?

17:51.630 --> 17:52.450
No, he's not.

17:52.450 --> 17:53.490
He's not!

17:53.490 --> 17:54.880
But we're still dressed the same!

17:54.880 --> 17:57.410
It's cold, so I want to 
tell people about hoodies,

17:57.410 --> 18:00.940
but still no one wears them, 
and I feel so defeated!

18:00.940 --> 18:03.890
Yeah, probably because 
they're against the dress code.

18:04.320 --> 18:08.430
But you've got too many layers on. 
You need to show it off.

18:08.430 --> 18:09.520
Okay...

18:09.520 --> 18:13.260
<i><i>He's violating the dress code,
but you want him to show it off?</i></i>

18:14.390 --> 18:15.530
There!

18:15.530 --> 18:18.280
Put those sunglasses back 
in the student council room!

18:16.400 --> 18:18.280
From that time

18:18.280 --> 18:20.620
Miyamura, hold your fingers like this.

18:20.620 --> 18:21.590
Yeah!

18:21.590 --> 18:22.810
Y-Yeah?

18:22.810 --> 18:23.690
Enough!

18:23.690 --> 18:26.620
Take this textbook and 
get back to your class!

18:27.160 --> 18:28.440
Tch.

18:28.440 --> 18:31.700
Why in the world is Shu so big on hoodies?

18:31.700 --> 18:34.920
Maybe they're like his favorite equipment.

18:35.380 --> 18:41.750
I'd have to be more like Iura before I went 
around flaunting something like this.

18:44.300 --> 18:46.640
Don't you dare try to be like Iura.

18:46.640 --> 18:49.170
In fact, be like anyone <i>except</i> him.

18:49.170 --> 18:50.440
<i><i>Iura-kun...</i></i>

18:51.310 --> 18:54.330
Ah, it's true! That's against the dress code!

18:54.330 --> 18:56.070
Oh, good morning, President.

18:56.070 --> 18:56.940
Good morning.

18:57.610 --> 19:00.000
I just ran into Iura-kun.

19:00.000 --> 19:02.750
He said you'd come around on "his style."

19:02.750 --> 19:05.540
I'm not. This is just for today.

19:05.540 --> 19:09.210
Iura was wearing a hoodie, too.
Did you scold him?

19:09.210 --> 19:10.940
No, not at all.

19:10.940 --> 19:13.460
He's a lost cause.

19:13.460 --> 19:15.590
<b>Resigned</b>

19:14.190 --> 19:15.590
<i><i>Iura-kun...</i></i>

19:16.530 --> 19:18.090
Let's get some lunch!

19:18.400 --> 19:21.670
Hey, they've got a new flavor of hot tea.

19:21.670 --> 19:22.670
Did you see it this morning?

19:22.670 --> 19:24.300
Really? What kind?

19:24.300 --> 19:26.100
One you'll like.

19:26.100 --> 19:28.220
Go, go!

19:28.220 --> 19:29.700
Wait, Miyamura.

19:30.750 --> 19:32.020
Your hood needs fixing.

19:32.020 --> 19:33.350
Oh, really?

19:33.970 --> 19:35.100
Thanks.

19:35.100 --> 19:38.230
You need to straighten 
 it out after you mess with it.

19:42.440 --> 19:44.330
Wh-What was that for?!

19:44.330 --> 19:46.150
Miyamura, that hoodie...

19:46.150 --> 19:46.990
Let's get going!

19:49.000 --> 19:51.040
<i><i>I can't fool Hori-san...</i></i>

19:53.250 --> 19:54.000
Miyamura.

19:54.000 --> 19:55.440
You wearin' a hoodie tomorrow, too?

19:55.440 --> 19:58.220
No, I'll just wear my cardigan.

19:57.130 --> 19:59.630
Stare...

20:05.510 --> 20:07.680
Stare...

20:09.160 --> 20:11.490
Miyamura, are you coming over today?

20:11.490 --> 20:13.590
No, I need to get home.

20:15.130 --> 20:17.850
Did something happen between them again?

20:17.850 --> 20:19.650
Who knows?

20:23.050 --> 20:24.410
Good morning, Hori-san.

20:24.410 --> 20:25.720
Good morning.

20:25.720 --> 20:27.220
It's pretty warm today, huh?

20:27.220 --> 20:29.290
Yeah, the sun's shining.

20:30.080 --> 20:31.970
Aren't you cold without a scarf, though?

20:31.970 --> 20:34.290
Stare...

20:35.540 --> 20:36.570
Hori-san?

20:38.930 --> 20:40.070
Come with me.

20:44.180 --> 20:45.180
Is something wrong?

20:50.840 --> 20:51.680
Hori-san...

20:55.760 --> 20:57.440
It smells like you!

20:57.440 --> 21:00.320
<b>Here</b>

20:57.440 --> 21:00.320
Huh? O-Oh, yeah?

21:00.320 --> 21:02.780
<i><i>I didn't realize what she was up to.</i></i>

21:02.780 --> 21:05.910
Yeah, this is your scent.

21:05.910 --> 21:08.450
Your hoodie smelled like someone else.

21:09.710 --> 21:12.580
Stare...

21:10.880 --> 21:12.580
Um...

21:12.580 --> 21:14.440
It was Shindo's.

21:14.440 --> 21:17.270
He left it at my place 
the last time he stayed over.

21:17.270 --> 21:18.840
That's what I figured.

21:18.840 --> 21:21.960
How could you tell? I washed it.

21:21.960 --> 21:24.030
It was obvious.

21:24.340 --> 21:27.090
<i>Not to me.</i>

21:27.450 --> 21:31.860
Besides, your scent is my favorite!

21:34.250 --> 21:36.990
Make sure you give Shindo-kun's hoodie back.

21:38.260 --> 21:39.610
Your hands are cold!

21:46.810 --> 21:47.960
Let's go.

21:47.960 --> 21:50.330
Huh? Oh, um, okay...

21:50.740 --> 21:52.830
<i><i>Just gonna leave it at that?</i></i>

21:57.210 --> 21:59.130
Oh, good morning!

21:59.130 --> 22:00.960
G-Good morning!

22:00.960 --> 22:02.620
What's going on?

22:02.620 --> 22:04.000
Y'know...

22:04.740 --> 22:06.530
It's a warm day.

23:36.470 --> 23:40.020
Next time
page.11 Chocolate
